data: {"id": "3d58f89a5e9a40bb-thinking-parallel_evidence-873", "run_id": "3d58f89a5e9a40bb", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集证据总结（仅针对 `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz`）\n\n### 1. 实体身份与生命周期\n- **Pod**: `workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz`, namespace: `aiops-case-03`, UID: `86b6a1bf-eb40-431d-bfb5-00fe85ed2475`\n- **Phase**: `Pending`（非 Running）\n- **Node**: `node2`\n- **容器**: `app`，状态 `Waiting`, Reason: `ContainerCreating`, restarts: 0\n\n### 2. 关键事实：Volume 挂载失败（根因已锁定）\n来自 `kubectl_describe` 和 `kubectl_get_yaml` 的 **Events** 及 Pod Spec：\n- **Event 原文**: `MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-c", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788772631921, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "3d58f89a5e9a40bb-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "3d58f89a5e9a40bb", "seq": 874, "ts_ms": 1788772640803, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 41.84, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-03", "name": "workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/3d58f89a5e9a40bb-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "38251af048f5d1b3f0c334f8f90cf1a606808e2f16fefeac53effba36c48d34a", "bytes": 2452}, "snapshot_sha256": "fe476b6637a090d1ee002d5de16ddf322cfd968d1500e6cfd4621f78a7a4a26c"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "3d58f89a5e9a40bb-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "3d58f89a5e9a40bb", "seq": 875, "ts_ms": 1788772640803, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "3d58f89a5e9a40bb-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "3d58f89a5e9a40bb", "seq": 876, "ts_ms": 1788772650645, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 9.842, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1843, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz 处于 ContainerCreating/Pending 状态，无法启动 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `FailedMount` (fact-8936aabb887c): `MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found` (x40 over 68m) | 直接指向挂载失败的根本原因，确认为 ConfigMap 缺失 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `FailedMount` (fact-f8727edac180): `Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input]... timed out waiting for the condition` (x27 over 66m) | 辅助证据，确认挂载超时现象 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | 状态 (fact-20c6fe996fb1, fact-d4e7356a4a8d): Pod `phase: Pending`，容器 `app` 处于 `ContainerCreating` (fact-f6b75818dc94) | 描述故障现场的具体状态 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` (fact-dfdf8846d5ee): `1` (reason: `ContainerCreating`) | 独立验证 Pod 持续卡在创建阶段 |\n| 5 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total` (fact-10f78691ea16): `0` | 排除因重启或 CrashLoopBackOff 导致的故障可能 |\n\n**证据综述：**\nKubernetes 事件日志（#1, #2）提供了决定性的因果线索，明确指出 `configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found` 导致了 `FailedMount`。Metrics（#4, #5）与 K8s 状态（#3）相互印证，确认了该 Pod 在长时间内持续处于 `Pending` 和 `ContainerCreating` 状态，且未发生容器重启。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod Spec 引用了不存在的 ConfigMap 'unavailable-config' → Kubelet 挂载 Volume 校验失败 (ConfigMap not found) → 触发 FailedMount 事件，Pod 无法进入 Running 状态 → Pod 卡在 Pending/ContainerCreating 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为：**Pod Spec 中引用了一个不存在的 ConfigMap `unavailable-config`**。\n\n证据表明，Kubelet 在尝试挂载名为 `input` 的 Volume 时，发现指定的 ConfigMap 不存在，导致挂载操作失败（详见证据 #1 `fact-8936aabb887c`）。这一上游原因直接导致了 `FailedMount` 事件的持续触发，使得容器无法启动，进而表现为 Pod 长期处于 `Pending` 状态（详见证据 #3 `fact-20c6fe996fb1`, #4 `fact-dfdf8846d5ee`）。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz 处于 ContainerCreating/Pending 状态，无法启动 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `FailedMount` (fact-8936aabb887c): `MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found` (x40 over 68m) | 直接指向挂载失败的根本原因，确认为 ConfigMap 缺失 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `FailedMount` (fact-f8727edac180): `Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input]... timed out waiting for the condition` (x27 over 66m) | 辅助证据，确认挂载超时现象 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | 状态 (fact-20c6fe996fb1, fact-d4e7356a4a8d): Pod `phase: Pending`，容器 `app` 处于 `ContainerCreating` (fact-f6b75818dc94) | 描述故障现场的具体状态 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` (fact-dfdf8846d5ee): `1` (reason: `ContainerCreating`) | 独立验证 Pod 持续卡在创建阶段 |\n| 5 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total` (fact-10f78691ea16): `0` | 排除因重启或 CrashLoopBackOff 导致的故障可能 |\n\n**证据综述：**\nKubernetes 事件日志（#1, #2）提供了决定性的因果线索，明确指出 `configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found` 导致了 `FailedMount`。Metrics（#4, #5）与 K8s 状态（#3）相互印证，确认了该 Pod 在长时间内持续处于 `Pending` 和 `ContainerCreating` 状态，且未发生容器重启。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod Spec 引用了不存在的 ConfigMap 'unavailable-config' → Kubelet 挂载 Volume 校验失败 (ConfigMap not found) → 触发 FailedMount 事件，Pod 无法进入 Running 状态 → Pod 卡在 Pending/ContainerCreating 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为：**Pod Spec 中引用了一个不存在的 ConfigMap `unavailable-config`**。\n\n证据表明，Kubelet 在尝试挂载名为 `input` 的 Volume 时，发现指定的 ConfigMap 不存在，导致挂载操作失败（详见证据 #1 `fact-8936aabb887c`）。这一上游原因直接导致了 `FailedMount` 事件的持续触发，使得容器无法启动，进而表现为 Pod 长期处于 `Pending` 状态（详见证据 #3 `fact-20c6fe996fb1`, #4 `fact-dfdf8846d5ee`）。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

