data: {"id": "3d58f89a5e9a40bb-final", "run_id": "3d58f89a5e9a40bb", "seq": 878, "ts_ms": 1788772650660, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz 处于 ContainerCreating/Pending 状态，无法启动 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `FailedMount` (fact-8936aabb887c): `MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found` (x40 over 68m) | 直接指向挂载失败的根本原因，确认为 ConfigMap 缺失 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `FailedMount` (fact-f8727edac180): `Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input]... timed out waiting for the condition` (x27 over 66m) | 辅助证据，确认挂载超时现象 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | 状态 (fact-20c6fe996fb1, fact-d4e7356a4a8d): Pod `phase: Pending`，容器 `app` 处于 `ContainerCreating` (fact-f6b75818dc94) | 描述故障现场的具体状态 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` (fact-dfdf8846d5ee): `1` (reason: `ContainerCreating`) | 独立验证 Pod 持续卡在创建阶段 |\n| 5 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total` (fact-10f78691ea16): `0` | 排除因重启或 CrashLoopBackOff 导致的故障可能 |\n\n**证据综述：**\nKubernetes 事件日志（#1, #2）提供了决定性的因果线索，明确指出 `configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found` 导致了 `FailedMount`。Metrics（#4, #5）与 K8s 状态（#3）相互印证，确认了该 Pod 在长时间内持续处于 `Pending` 和 `ContainerCreating` 状态，且未发生容器重启。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod Spec 引用了不存在的 ConfigMap 'unavailable-config' → Kubelet 挂载 Volume 校验失败 (ConfigMap not found) → 触发 FailedMount 事件，Pod 无法进入 Running 状态 → Pod 卡在 Pending/ContainerCreating 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为：**Pod Spec 中引用了一个不存在的 ConfigMap `unavailable-config`**。\n\n证据表明，Kubelet 在尝试挂载名为 `input` 的 Volume 时，发现指定的 ConfigMap 不存在，导致挂载操作失败（详见证据 #1 `fact-8936aabb887c`）。这一上游原因直接导致了 `FailedMount` 事件的持续触发，使得容器无法启动，进而表现为 Pod 长期处于 `Pending` 状态（详见证据 #3 `fact-20c6fe996fb1`, #4 `fact-dfdf8846d5ee`）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.2m\n├─ 问题定位: 21.2s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 41.8s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz: 41.8s (Evidence 33.0s, RCA 8.7s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.8s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz**: pod-volume-mount-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 72.922, "metrics": {"run_id": "3d58f89a5e9a40bb", "mttr": {"value": "1.2m", "seconds": 72.92670249938965, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-volume-mount-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 72926.70249938965, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 70310.59265136719, "tool_calls": 14, "executed_tool_calls": 9, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 4, "successful_tool_calls": 13, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 5952.0423412323, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 2279.949426651001}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 21220.72124481201, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 41840.4655456543, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 9841.966390609741, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

